{'symbol': 'DPZ', 'date': '2021-04-05 07:30:00', 'title': "DOMINO'S PIZZA ANNOUNCES RECAPITALIZATION TRANSACTION", 'text': "ANN ARBOR,\xa0MICH., APRIL 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOMINO'S PIZZA, INC. (NYSE: DPZ), THE LARGEST PIZZA COMPANY IN THE WORLD BASED ON RETAIL SALES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CERTAIN OF ITS SUBSIDIARIES INTEND TO COMPLETE A RECAPITALIZATION TRANSACTION, WHICH WILL INCLUDE THE REFINANCING OF A PORTION OF THEIR OUTSTANDING SECURITIZATION DEBT WITH A NEW SERIES OF SECURITIZED DEBT."}